From: NixOS local patches
Subject: [PATCH] fix(libei): forward one scroll representation per device frame

Hyprland sends continuous and value120 representations of each wheel event.
Prefer value120 per axis within the original device frame, preserving continuous
only frames and fractional wheel steps. Clear pending events at capture/device
boundaries. Keep the separate Hyprland value120 units correction on the sender.

